### ==============================================================================
### PWA Store API - Phase 7: Moderator Portal & Content Review
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000/api/v1/moderator
### All routes require Bearer Token (Sanctum) with 'moderator' or 'admin' role
### Decision routes are rate-limited via throttle:write (30 req/min)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/moderator
@contentType = application/json
@acceptJson = application/json
@acceptLanguage = ar
@authToken = <TOKEN>

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. GET /moderator/pwas/pending - قائمة التطبيقات المعلقة قيد المراجعة (FIFO)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/pwas/pending?per_page=12&page=1
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Response: 200 OK
# {
#   "success": true,
