### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. GET /moderator/pwas/{id} - تفاصيل تطبيق محدد للمراجعة والتدقيق
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/pwas/24
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

