### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. POST /moderator/pwas/{id}/approve - الموافقة على التطبيق ونشره (200 OK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/pwas/24/approve
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Response: 200 OK
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "تمت الموافقة على التطبيق ونشره بنجاح.",
